    "2026-05-16 evening 2 — v5.2 cadence-doctrine: systemPromptOverride principle 6 augmented (Goldilocks scope-sizing + 5m + lock + sprint=more-work-per-acquisition); WORKFLOW CONTRACT line: 'loop while LOOP CONDITIONS hold; NO per-fire time-budget cap; release lock at natural completion'.",
    "2026-05-17 — v5.3 synergy iteration: header v3→v5.3 + 3 new operator-verbatim quotes (no-decide + do-big-chunks); systemPromptOverride 4 new core principles (13 output_governance + 14 STEP 0 gates + 15 mcp_discipline + 16 scope_tier enum); WORKFLOW CONTRACT line augmented with Step 0 NEW v5.3 GATES (git_state_refresh + in_session_directive_gate); v5_3_augmented timestamp.",
    "2026-05-17 — v5.3.1 calibration (same session): output_governance recalibrated per operator-recalibration 2026-05-17 ('I dont see not real opeartor territory, nothing you can't handle or if not really come back clear to me'). Output governance moved from RECOMMENDATION-form filter to EXECUTION-boundary filter. Agent THINKS+PROPOSES+STAGES+SURFACES+RECOMMENDS freely (including on commit/install/cron/promotion decisions); operator-territory = EXECUTION irreversibles + sacrosanct sources + live-infra interruption + cross-project boundary. systemPromptOverride principle 13 rewritten; profile YAML output_governance block rewritten with agent_vs_operator_responsibility_split + execution_overstep_filter + allowed_agent_recommendations + when_genuinely_blocked_come_back_clear; profile YAML prompt_templates.system principle 18 rewritten; operator_territory_overstep anti-pattern body recalibrated. Augment-not-rewrite preserved: every change via Edit; v5.3 substrate preserved + augmented. P5 cycle 5 of 2026-05-16+17 sequence."
